{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p131a","title":"曹操三辞魏王爵，诏不许","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p131a-account","label":"《献帝传》续载诏答","text":"曹操上书三辞，诏三次不许，又手诏要求勿再固辞。","evidence":["wudi-e-p131a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"辞爵","evidence":["wudi-e-p131a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"不许","evidence":["wudi-e-p131a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"进爵魏王时","year":216,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p131a-q","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"],"chronology":"wudi-y216","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o181","basis":"进爵魏王时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1049,"P131a"],"order":396}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p131a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7b8047f59864c3fd464d","layer":"pei","quote":"魏王上书三辞，诏三报不许。又手诏曰：“大圣以功德为高美，以忠和为典训；故创业垂名，使百世可希；行道制义，使力行可效；是以勋烈无穷，休光茂著。稷、契载元首之聪明，周、邵因文、武之智用；虽经营庶官，仰叹俯思；其对岂有若君者哉？朕惟古人之功，美之如彼；思君忠勤之绩，茂之如此；是以每将镂符析瑞，陈礼命册，寤寐慨然，自忘守文之不德焉。今君重违朕命，固辞恳切，非所以称朕心而训后世也。其抑志撙节，勿复固辞！”","attribution":"《献帝传》续载诏答","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fdb966d8839f43c95d67","start":0,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
